role":"(voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/alTb0DlcPIbcwM08WSmxFai58sd.jpg"},{"id":1243965,"name":"Tomohisa Aso","role":"(voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4tC6CfvQnQpIMclDyGncKbz46w3.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"The Cat and the Dragon","overview":"Rimasto orfano fin dalla schiusa del suo uovo, un drago solitario di nome \"Zio Ali\" viene accolto da una famiglia di gatti magici e cresciuto come uno di loro. Crescendo, Zio Ali diventa il protettore dei gatti, determinato a difenderli dagli umani. Tuttavia, vedendo i gatti legare con gli esseri umani grazie alla loro magia, Zio Ali inizia lentamente a sciogliere il ghiaccio nei loro confronti, in questo racconto toccante e agrodolce."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Cat and the Dragon","overview":"An orphan since hatched, a lone dragon named “Uncle Wings” is taken in by a family of magic-wielding cats and raised as one of their own. As Uncle Wings grows, he becomes the cats’ protector, determined to keep them safe from humans. But as he watches the cats connect with humans using their magic, Uncle Wings slowly starts to warm up to humans in this heartfelt, bittersweet tale."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"深い深い、森の奥。一匹の火吹き竜が、魔法を操る猫たちと暮らしています。生まれる前に実親を失ったその竜は、偶然出会った一匹の母猫によって育てられました。猫たちは、空を飛び火を噴く“ちょっと変わった猫”として、竜を家族に迎え入れたのです。好奇心旺盛な森の猫たちの生き方は十猫十色。竜は母猫への恩を返すかのように、森の猫たちに寄り添い、見守り続けます。そんな竜を猫たちは“羽のおじちゃん”と呼び、慕っています。一方、人間は畏怖を込めて“猫竜”と呼ぶのでした……。これは、猫に育てられた竜と猫たち、そして人間たちが織りなす、心あたたかく、そしてちょっと切なくなる不思議な絆の物語──。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tBiDZKJeNRShDyY0gVVTLuWctjL.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tBiDZKJeNRShDyY0gVVTLuWctjL.png","language":"en","width":1200,"height":533},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6R1daVAHkVZhP9lr3KUyQhLYadX.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6R1daVAHkVZhP9lr3KUyQhLYadX.png","lang